canon = "Ch7 (Keeper 2026-11-01, [C]): same dining room as ch6; men have eaten, gold goblets; Tamlin seats her at the far end, meat and sauce and bread, pale sparkling wine; invisible hands shove her back into the seat, she can't rise until she eats; she sniffs (no metallic stench, faeries can't lie), chicken first, clears the plate; reaching for more chocolate torte, the food vanishes. Lucien: the tunic isn't as pretty as a dress. Feyre: I'd prefer not to wear that dress. Tamlin: I don't keep slaves (timeline ch7). Invented (X): 'Sit.' for ch7, Lucien's wording about Andras, 'held_again'."
